      color: '#0D9488'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">edge_gate (仅来自 g)</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    关注 “哪里有结构突变” —— 条纹边缘、几何边界、亮暗跃迁。这是网络看到“有内容”的位置。</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">spec_gate (来自 g, x, s 三者)</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    关注 “这些结构突变是否与高反光相关” —— 结合输入亮度与高光概率, 区分普通边缘与高光边缘。</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">final_gate = edge_gate · spec_gate</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    两者相乘, 仅在“高光区且有结构”处注入增强; 在均匀漫反射区门控接近 0, 避免误扰动。</span></p>
    sourceLayout: ad982dae5130d4b272abe512c63f15038d5da899bef3a3eab88c00064d41cb07
