      text: <p><span style="color:#DB2777;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">projection_branch (大核 7×7)</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    通用空间投影, 保留稳定的纹理结构表示, 是基准路径</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#DB2777;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">specular_branch + FFC</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    小核 + FFC 频域, 专门处理高光相关的频域/空间异常, 使输出对高反光更敏感</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#DB2777;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">β 受控强度 (可学习)</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    output = spec_refined + β · spec_refined · final_gate, 初始化为小值; 训练逐渐学到合适注入幅度, 避免破坏预训练梯度分支特征分布</span></p>
